				{
					"id": 701060301,
					"content": "Here's your Chilled Meat.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701060302
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 701060302,
					"content": "Wow, this Chilled Meat looks pretty good to me... Now I just have one more ingredient left to find.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701060303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Harris"
				},
				{
					"id": 701060303,
					"content": "Have you heard of the Great Snowboar King? People say that it's a fierce beast dwelling deep in the mountains...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701060304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Harris"
				},
				{
					"id": 701060304,
					"content": "...And recipes say that its exquisite meat is well-suited to any method of cooking...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701060305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Harris"
				},
				{
					"id": 701060305,
					"content": "Huh... You mean, this?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701060306
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 701060306,
					"content": "What? Wait... Yes! How... Where? Is this pure coincidence, or...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701060307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Harris"
				},
				{
					"id": 701060307,
					"content": "...Well, anyway... This means I now have all the ingredients I need.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701060308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Harris"
				},
				{
					"id": 701060308,
					"content": "While I was waiting for you to get back with the ingredients, I formalized my recipe. If one thing's certain, it's that this is definitely a far cry from the ancient recipe I started with...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701060309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Harris"
				},
				{
					"id": 701060309,
					"content": "But as long as the end result tastes good, I'm not concerned about how I get there. I think I'm going to name this dish \"Goulash.\" Sounds exotic but it's very easy to make... Why don't you try for yourself?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701060310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Harris"
				},
				{
					"id": 701060310,
					"content": "Don't worry, I've factored in the difficulty of trying to cook in an inhospitable environment like this. So I kept the preparation time to a minimum and made sure the cooking method is a straightforward one.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701060311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Harris"
				},
				{
					"id": 701060311,
					"content": "Go on, give it a try. After you've made it once, you'll find it's easy to remember if you ever want to cook it again.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Harris"
				}
			]
		},
