			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 701060401,
					"content": "About the Great Snowboar King meat you wanted...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701060402
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 701060402,
					"content": "Ah, you've managed to get your hands on some Great Snowboar King meat, have you?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701060403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Harris"
				},
				{
					"id": 701060403,
					"content": "Here you are.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701060404
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 701060404,
					"content": "Well, in that case... That's all the ingredients accounted for.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701060405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Harris"
				},
				{
					"id": 701060405,
					"content": "While I was waiting for you to get back with the ingredients, I formalized my recipe. If one thing's certain, it's that this is definitely a far cry from the ancient recipe I started with...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						701060406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Harris"
				},
				{
					"id": 701060406,
					"content": "But as long as the end result tastes good, I'm not concerned about how I get there. I think I'm going to name this dish \"Goulash.\" Sounds exotic but it's very easy to make... Why don't you try for yourself?",
